src at p0 0
tk at p0 1
base mul p1 128
rest sub p2 base
big gt rest 128
cnt select big 128 rest
zp call zpage
s0 rec zp tk
s fold rbyte cnt s0
pg at s 0
t at s 1
src2 set src p1 pg
